    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the Powers vested in me under the Section (I) of 66 (C) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance and the provision of section 66 (G) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance, I do hereby informed that the name mentioned below was elected and declared by me as Vice Chairman of Lahugala Pradeshiya Sabha in Ampara District with the Co-Chaired of Hon. Chairman of Pradeshiya Sabha, Lahugala in the meeting held on the day of 01.08.2025 at 10.30 am at the Lahugala Pradeshiya Sabha Hall.",
